        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="future_e42" value="queued writes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#3B3630;strokeWidth=1.6;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#141210;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a_q" target="d_acl">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f_title" value="<div style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">Solstice Hotel Group - future state, production-hardened</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:3px">One agent definition, two runtimes, one tool layer. 140 properties, one cluster. Guest and reservation data comes from the systems of record on the right.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1240" height="74" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f_legend" value="<div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Reading this diagram</div><div style="font-size:11px;margin-top:4px"><b>TODAY</b> (solid border) runs in the build demoed on the call.<br/><b>FUTURE</b> (dashed border) is production hardening, designed but not built.<br/>A TODAY node whose detail starts with &quot;Future:&quot; keeps its job and gets hardened.<br/>Solid arrow = request path. Dashed arrow = fallback or cross-cutting.<br/>[fallback n] points at the panel on the right.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="20" width="1160" height="74" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f_panel" value="<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">When something upstream fails</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:#5A534B;margin-bottom:6px">Degrade to a smaller, honest answer. Never to a confident guess.</div><div style="margin-top:9px"><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700">1. PMS or CRS unreachable</span><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:1px">The circuit opens. Reads come from the Redis cache, stamped stale_as_of. With no cache the tool returns grounded:false, Sol says it cannot confirm that and books a callback. Writes queue. Nothing is guessed.</div></div><div style="margin-top:9px"><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700">2. Model provider down or throttled</span><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:1px">The model gateway retries, then fails over from the Anthropic API to Amazon Bedrock. If both are down, chat answers only what the rules engine can prove and offers a human; voice plays a held message and transfers.</div></div><div style="margin-top:9px"><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700">3. Telephony degraded</span><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:1px">A standby DID on a second carrier takes the traffic, and the number on the site is runtime config. If the assistant itself is unhealthy, calls forward to central reservations and a session row is still opened.</div></div><div style="margin-top:9px"><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700">4. Email or SMS provider fails</span><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:1px">Same adapter, different sender: Amazon SES. If every sender fails the proposal stays on the queue and the console reads not sent. A proposal is never marked sent on a failed send.</div></div><div style="margin-top:9px"><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700">5. Database write outage</span><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:1px">Multi-AZ failover. During it the app is read-only: chat continues from cache, new turns buffer in SQS and replay in order. The dead-letter queue is alerted on, never drained silently.</div></div><div style="margin-top:9px"><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700">6. Realtime stream drops</span><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:1px">The supervisor console falls back to five-second polling and shows a live updates degraded banner. The transcript is rebuilt from Postgres, which is the same source the archive already reads.</div></div><div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">The rule underneath all six: degrade to a smaller, honest answer plus a human. Never to a confident guess.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#FFFDF9;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2020" y="110" width="440" height="1256" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="today" name="Today (MVP)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2460" pageHeight="1060" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="y_guest" value="<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">Guest side</div><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:#5A534B">Public, one Netlify deploy</div>" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=56;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDE5D8;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;swimlaneFillColor=#FBF8F3;horizontal=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="340" height="388" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_land" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Landing page</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Netlify CDN. Typography-driven, no stock photography, support number displayed.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_guest">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_bub" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Chat bubble</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">React. Streaming replies, typing indicator, tool chips, inline policy citations.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_guest">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="166" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_ph" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">PENDING</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Support phone number</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Telnyx DID, reused from a retired connection. Waiting on account funding.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A6A1F;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="y_guest">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="276" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_dep" value="<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">Deploy</div><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:#5A534B">One repo, one build</div>" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=56;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDE5D8;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;swimlaneFillColor=#FBF8F3;horizontal=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="570" width="340" height="388" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_repo" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Repository</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">App, functions, schema, agent definition and plans in one place.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_dep">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_build" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Netlify build</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">vite build to dist, esbuild bundling for netlify/functions, /api/* rewrite.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_dep">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="166" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_env" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Secret boundary</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Only SUPABASE_URL and the anon key reach the bundle. Service role, Telnyx and Anthropic keys stay server-side.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_dep">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="276" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_rt" value="<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">Runtimes</div><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:#5A534B">Two engines, one definition</div>" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=56;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDE5D8;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;swimlaneFillColor=#FBF8F3;horizontal=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="110" width="380" height="498" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_chat" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">PENDING</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">/api/chat</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Netlify Function. Holds the Anthropic key, runs the tool loop, writes every turn to Postgres.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A6A1F;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="y_rt">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_claude" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">BLOCKED</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Claude (Anthropic API)</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Key is not workspace-scoped and currently 400s. Code is written against the contract.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C2F1F;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;" vertex="1" parent="y_rt">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="166" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_sol" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">BLOCKED</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Telnyx AI Assistant &quot;Sol&quot;</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Voice runtime. Blocked on account funding, not on design.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C2F1F;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;" vertex="1" parent="y_rt">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="276" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_ev" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">PENDING</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">/api/telnyx/events</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Verifies the signature, diffs the cumulative history, inserts only new turns.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A6A1F;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="y_rt">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="386" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_tools" value="<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">Tool layer</div><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:#5A534B">Netlify Functions, shared by both runtimes</div>" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=56;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDE5D8;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;swimlaneFillColor=#FBF8F3;horizontal=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="570" width="380" height="498" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_tl" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Shared tool layer</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Concierge tools and group tools. One implementation, so voice and chat cannot diverge.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_tools">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_rules" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Rules as data</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">src/lib/rules: thresholds, seasonal caps, blackouts. Changing one is a one-line edit.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_tools">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="166" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_av" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">availability_service</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">The net-new tool. Deterministic simulated inventory, stamped simulated_inventory_service.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_tools">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="276" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_envl" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">ToolResult envelope</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">ok, grounded, citations, masked_fields, latency_ms on every tool without exception.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_tools">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="386" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_data" value="<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">Data</div><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:#5A534B">One Supabase project</div>" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=56;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDE5D8;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;swimlaneFillColor=#FBF8F3;horizontal=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="110" width="380" height="608" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_pg" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Postgres and RLS</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Concierge cannot read inquiries, group sales cannot read messages. Scoping is a database policy.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_data">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_rtm" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Realtime</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">postgres_changes on sessions, messages, tool_invocations, inquiries and proposals.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_data">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="166" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_st" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Storage</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Generated proposal PDFs, handed out as time-limited signed URLs.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_data">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="276" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_aud" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">audit_log and tool_invocations</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Who approved, overrode or sent what, and every tool call with masked arguments.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_data">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="386" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_seed" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">CSV seeder</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Parses data/*.csv, extracts the rules buried in free-text notes, quarantines the -395 suite rate.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_data">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="496" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_del" value="<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#141210">Delivery</div><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:#5A534B">One adapter, one provider</div>" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=56;rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#EDE5D8;strokeColor=#6B625A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;swimlaneFillColor=#FBF8F3;horizontal=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="110" width="340" height="388" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_ad" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">LIVE</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Channel adapter</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Email if there is an address, SMS if only a number, flagged if neither.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F5C3D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="y_del">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="56" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_em" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">PENDING</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Telnyx Email API</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Branded HTML with the PDF attached. Waiting on the sending domain.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A6A1F;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="y_del">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="166" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="y_sm" value="<div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#5A534B">BLOCKED</div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#141210;margin-top:1px">Telnyx SMS (10DLC)</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#3B3630;margin-top:2px">Carrier registration cannot clear before submission. Upstream of Telnyx, so no vendor choice fixes it.</div>" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#141210;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C2F1F;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;" vertex="1" parent="y_del">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="276" width="300" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
